    "detailed_description": "<h1>MAKE SURE TO WISHLIST SILENT PIT!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784160/extras/f6d0f4d7eca96af35abb33b9d3421fad.poster.avif?t=1752499457\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784160/extras/f6d0f4d7eca96af35abb33b9d3421fad.webm?t=1752499457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784160/extras/f6d0f4d7eca96af35abb33b9d3421fad.mp4?t=1752499457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silent Pit</strong> is a first-person horror game developed <strong>solo</strong>. Trapped deep underground with no clear way out, you must survive the creeping presence that stalks the dark and fight your way back to the surface. A harsh and intense experience where every sound and every decision matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An evolving nightmare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in the depths, without guidance or safety, you are left to rely on instinct. Light is scarce, noise is dangerous, and every mistake could be your last. The environment watches, reacts, and adapts. No two playthroughs are the same \u2014 and nothing is ever safe for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784160/extras/ce5d8d1ec363b42c4335bc3b4bd79ace.poster.avif?t=1752499457\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784160/extras/ce5d8d1ec363b42c4335bc3b4bd79ace.webm?t=1752499457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784160/extras/ce5d8d1ec363b42c4335bc3b4bd79ace.mp4?t=1752499457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Constant tension</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix damaged systems, manage scarce resources, and stay alert to the sounds echoing through the walls. A burst pipe, a running pump, or a forgotten device left humming in the dark \u2014 every choice becomes a potential threat in this suffocating, reactive world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784160/extras/df4e280c191624bd2b61afc413fa1a0b.poster.avif?t=1752499457\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784160/extras/df4e280c191624bd2b61afc413fa1a0b.webm?t=1752499457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784160/extras/df4e280c191624bd2b61afc413fa1a0b.mp4?t=1752499457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A relentless pursuit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the closer it gets. The thing that stalks you never shows itself directly, but its presence is always felt. With every step forward, the pressure rises \u2014 and the margin for error disappears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784160/extras/7b81b9b71b8983713bb35edcd0fbb4e1.poster.avif?t=1752499457\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784160/extras/7b81b9b71b8983713bb35edcd0fbb4e1.webm?t=1752499457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784160/extras/7b81b9b71b8983713bb35edcd0fbb4e1.mp4?t=1752499457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raw, immersive survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No maps to carry. No hand-holding. Just you, the dark, and the tools you manage to scavenge. The inventory is physical, diegetic, and slow to access \u2014 and in <i>Silent Pit</i>, time is rarely on your side. Staying silent may be the only way to stay alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic enemy that adapts to your behavior.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physical systems to repair and manage under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear, semi-open exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal survival mechanics where every sound counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unpredictable and oppressive horror experience.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silent Pit</strong> is a first-person horror game developed <strong>solo</strong>. Trapped deep underground with no clear way out, you must survive the creeping presence that stalks the dark and fight your way back to the surface. A harsh and intense experience where every sound and every decision matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An evolving nightmare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in the depths, without guidance or safety, you are left to rely on instinct. Light is scarce, noise is dangerous, and every mistake could be your last. The environment watches, reacts, and adapts. No two playthroughs are the same \u2014 and nothing is ever safe for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784160/extras/ce5d8d1ec363b42c4335bc3b4bd79ace.poster.avif?t=1752499457\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784160/extras/ce5d8d1ec363b42c4335bc3b4bd79ace.webm?t=1752499457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784160/extras/ce5d8d1ec363b42c4335bc3b4bd79ace.mp4?t=1752499457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Constant tension</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix damaged systems, manage scarce resources, and stay alert to the sounds echoing through the walls. A burst pipe, a running pump, or a forgotten device left humming in the dark \u2014 every choice becomes a potential threat in this suffocating, reactive world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784160/extras/df4e280c191624bd2b61afc413fa1a0b.poster.avif?t=1752499457\" width=616 height=318 ><sourc