        "notes": "Adult Content Warning for Silent Pit\r\n\r\nSilent Pit is a first-person psychological horror game focused on atmosphere, isolation, and mental tension. The game includes the following content that may be disturbing to some players:\r\n\r\nDepictions of mutilated corpses: While not photorealistic, these visuals are unsettling and may be disturbing.\r\n\r\nScene involving suicide: The game contains a non-interactive scene portraying suicide as part of the narrative. Viewer discretion is advised.\r\n\r\nPsychological distress and oppressive atmosphere: The game features dark environments, constant tension, and a strong sense of isolation.\r\n\r\nJump scares: Sudden events designed to startle the player.\r\n\r\nNo sexual content, nudity, drug or alcohol use, or depictions of sexual assault.\r\n\r\nThis game is intended for a mature audience and may not be suitable for players sensitive to themes of death, suicide, or psychological horror."
